        <p>ONI COUGH—JUST USE 1)931'T COUGH—JUST USE EAT " A SIMPLE Facr. Ask throughout the woild la any country that can be named, von will find KEATING'S LOZENGES largely sold. Thare is absolutely no remedy that is so speedy in giving relief, so certain to cure, and yet the meat delicate can take them 1.. --LING'S COUGH LOZENGES. c •IP‘A TING'S COUGH LOZENGES.</p>
