        <p>(12s. Bd.) for having been drnnk and disorderly in Priam'. izate on the 2.9•11 o,,tober. 1893 —P.O. Clough proved the offence and mentioned that defendant gave himself up voluntarily. THURSDAY.— Before the Mayor (chairman), and Alderman</p>
